title: "Graphene Phonon Reservoir: reproducible negative result in reduced-order simulation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Gómez Coeto"
    given-names: "José Rodolfo"
repository-code: "https://github.com/paradoxelite/graphene-phonon-reservoir"
url: "https://github.com/paradoxelite/graphene-phonon-reservoir"
version: 1.0.3
date-released: 2026-08-16
abstract: >-
  Reduced-order, contact-aware simulation of coupled graphene-inspired modes.
  A fixed paired protocol over twelve seeds found no computational advantage
  over a mechanically linear ablation or a digital delay-line baseline.
keywords:
  - physical reservoir computing
  - graphene resonator
  - negative result
  - reproducible simulation
